course: dictionary
lesson: 8574
title: Schedule
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A schedule is a plan that shows when things will happen. «Zara's teacher checked the power-cut schedule» tells you it is a list of times, because you check a list of times, and power cuts happen at certain times. The clue is in the words around it.
explain: Schedule can also be a verb, meaning to plan something for a certain time. Ask yourself: does the word fit as a list of times, or as a plan? Then put your meaning into the sentence in place of the hard word and check that it still makes sense.
explain: Schedule often appears in phrases. «On schedule» means on time, «behind schedule» means late, and «ahead of schedule» means early. «Streaming is hard work with editing, schedules and comments to deal with» shows that a schedule is a plan that can keep you busy.
fact: A schedule is a plan that shows when things will happen.
fact: In the US and Canada, a schedule can mean a timetable for buses, trains or TV.
fact: As a verb, «to schedule» means to plan something for a certain time.
fact: «On schedule» means on time; «behind schedule» means late.
fact: The word family is schedule, schedules, scheduled and scheduling.
exercise: «Zara's teacher checked the power-cut schedule to see when the power would go off.» What is a schedule here? | A type of power cut | A tired feeling | *A plan that shows when things will happen | A kind of bus
exercise: The bus is ten minutes late, so it is behind schedule. What does behind schedule mean? | Cancelled for ever | Exactly on time, every single day | Earlier than planned | *Later than planned
exercise: The teacher will ___ the trip for Friday. Which word fits best? | tidy | drooped | *schedule | barely
test: «Some streamers have busy schedules, with editing and comments to deal with.» What does schedules mean here? | *Plans of when their work happens | Lists of jokes | Sad, glum days | Cameras and microphones
test: Which phrase means late? | *Behind schedule | On schedule | Ahead of schedule | A tight schedule
exam: What does a bus schedule in Canada show? | *When the buses leave and arrive | Who drives the bus | How many people are on board | The colour of the bus
